msgid ""
"The `ARK Flow Open Source Optical Flow and Distance Sensor "
"<https://arkelectron.com/product/ark-flow/>`__ is an open source optical "
"flow sensor including a Broadcom AFBR lidar which uses the CAN protocol to "
"communicate with the autopilot.  This can be used to improve horizontal "
"position control especially in GPS denied environments."
msgstr ""
"`ARK Flow 开源光流与测距传感器 <https://arkelectron.com/product/ark-flow/>`__ "
"是一款开源光流传感器，集成 Broadcom AFBR 激光雷达，通过 CAN 协议与飞控通信。该传感器可用于改善水平位置控制，尤其适用于 GPS "
"拒止环境。"

